{"id":"n78291-1-7","stage":5,"title":"참가자 · 参加者","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78291-1-7-1","ko":"유민이가 학교 가요제에 나갔다면서?","zh":"裕敏去参加学校歌唱比赛了，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"가요제에","meaning":"歌唱比赛","explanation":"가요제：歌唱比赛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가요제","audio":"/audio/fb4117fdf4ed9ff73585.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16335","senseId":"1","lemma":"가요제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요제에","audio":"/audio/30811cde4c3c0cb1f560.mp3"}},{"text":"나갔다면서?","meaning":"参加，出战","explanation":"나가다：参加，出战；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"9","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나갔다면서","audio":"/audio/1931c4216e7639b494d2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"fb4117fdf4ed9ff7","term":"가요제","zh":"歌唱比赛","audio":"/audio/fb4117fdf4ed9ff73585.mp3","entryId":"16335","definition":"很多人比拼唱歌实力的大会。","pronunciation":["가요제"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"参加，出战","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"出席聚会，加入竞技比赛，或以候补身份加入选举。","pronunciation":["나가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17c0c515c7205ea31180.